<item><title>Gunmen kill journalist Veronica Gordon in Western Equatoria ambush</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/gunmen-kill-journalist-veronica-gordon-in-western-equatoria-589a98/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/gunmen-kill-journalist-veronica-gordon-in-western-equatoria-589a98/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Gordon&apos;s killing came as delegates returning from SPLM primaries were ambushed in Miri Loko village, leaving two others wounded, while the attackers&apos; identities and motive remain.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:35:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan&apos;s electoral commission moves December vote to February 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-s-electoral-commission-moves-december-vote-to-f42b0f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-s-electoral-commission-moves-december-vote-to-f42b0f/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The National Elections Commission has pushed polling day to February 11, 2027, nearly two months past the December 2026 deadline set in law.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:18:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-s-electoral-commission-moves-december-vote-to-f42b0f/share.jpg" length="42339" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-s-electoral-commission-moves-december-vote-to-f42b0f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Two killed in attack on SPLM delegates in South Sudan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/two-killed-in-attack-on-splm-delegates-in-south-sudan-0427fc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/two-killed-in-attack-on-splm-delegates-in-south-sudan-0427fc/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Gunmen ambushed a vehicle carrying ruling party delegates in Western Equatoria State, leaving two dead and others missing.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:06:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan Bar Association to sue Interior Ministry</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-bar-association-to-sue-interior-ministry-342b05/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-bar-association-to-sue-interior-ministry-342b05/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The association plans legal action over traffic police demanding US dollar fines and high license plate fees for commercial vehicles.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:52:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan mourns General Joseph Lagu Yanga</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-mourns-general-joseph-lagu-yanga-59c9d6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-mourns-general-joseph-lagu-yanga-59c9d6/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>A tribute remembers the late General Joseph Lagu Yanga, who died in 2026, for his courage and call for peace.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:47:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
